project.description:
The public web presence for Velocity Silicon (the company commercializing the
AiToChip accelerators). Scaffolded with the Base44 AI app builder and customized;
deployed on Vercel.

A marketing website built on the open-source "Odyssey" Astro theme (blog,
landing pages, contact forms, theme switcher). 70 commits of customization;
achieves strong Lighthouse performance via Astro. Deployed on Vercel.
